{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And I will harden.</b> As though he forgot the plagues that were struck on Israel's account." "<b>And I will be honored through Pharaoh.</b> Then My honor will be seen in the world, through the drowning of Pharaoh and his army." "<b>And the Egyptians shall know.</b> Those who remain, and also those who drown, before their death — that I am YHWH." "<b>And they did so.</b> Scripture held to a terse path, to say that they turned back."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:19.952980020Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}